  "question": {
    "text": "A bag contains&nbsp;<math><mn>21</mn></math> markers with numbers&nbsp;<math><mn>1</mn></math> to <math><mn>21</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;A marker is drawn at random and then replaced and then a second marker is drawn. The probability that the first number is odd and the second is even is",
