  "solution": {
    "text": "Probability that the first marker is odd <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Probability that the second marker is even <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />The required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>441</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
